# Model Policy

- This project uses **Sonnet only** — `claude-sonnet-4-6`.
- Never use Haiku, Opus, or any other model family.
- **Sonnet** (`claude-sonnet-4-6`): all agent pipelines (ingestion, analysis, benchmark, gap, leads), including search planning, niche filtering, and franchise classification.
- Use `callSonnet()` from `backend/anthropic.js` — never call the Anthropic API directly with other models.
